{"server":"tw","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_05_beg","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_05","title":"祝福的歌謠","storyCode":"FC-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"db138b66c56c03d008e428b46c78c3ef254bdce1318c2571039db0231d873cce","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"眾人逃出石高原野，在迎向新生活的前夜，點起篝火，準備告別。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草，你那邊固定了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咻——好了，這是最後一頂帳篷啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你們的力氣可真大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你們是不是要走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，我和陳陳要調查的就是那些被法術控制的“鬼魂士兵”，這邊的事情結束之後，我們還有其他的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這裡已經是特倫特郡轄區的邊界，應該不會再有駐軍找你們麻煩啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，要是我們把秩序維持得更好一些，這麼多混亂和冤枉的事情，就都不會發生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你在說什麼呢？要不是因為你們，我們都不知道能不能活到現在呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是在我家，今晚我就要請你們喝接骨木酒，給你們送行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我們現在手裡的物資，大半還都是你們從......從那個“羅德島”帶過來的，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我們給那個羅德島寄信，你們能收到嗎？到時候大家找到地方落腳了，跟你們說一聲，你們要是再路過這附近，可以來做客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，應該可以吧？要是維多利亞的紛爭結束，然後陳陳也見到了那個人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你呢，葦草？接下來你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......應該會確認所有人都安頓好了，再去做自己的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算離開了石高原野，擺脫了罪名，沒有了熄火鐘的管制......塔拉人也依然生活在一片泥濘的土地上，他們還是會寸步難行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，我應該再幫他們想想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉和維多利亞的語言，我都會說，之後如果進入城市，遇到各種不同的人，我都可以交涉......會比其他人方便一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，今天你去找羅德島的安全屋時，有沒有什麼人跟蹤你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......應該沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我記得你的提醒。如果那些士兵是衝著我來的......我不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......謝謝你的好心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，到時候葦草肯不肯把帳篷賣一頂給我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是城裡工廠做出來的帆布，暴雨澆上半個月也不會漏水，正適合拿來改造我的小拖車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她心地很善良，你也不會昧著良心出價。我猜，你們的交易應該是能談成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我開玩笑的，我哪裡有錢買這麼好的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過誰能想到呢，前幾天我們還為怎麼活命發愁，現在卻能睡進工廠做出來的結實帳篷，夜裡也能生火了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她們很有本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也懂礦石病的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不連貫的口哨旋律）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"籠罩溪谷的霧靄啊......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......將她遠行的身影遮蔽......♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是很好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些追過我的人裡，現在應該只有你還記得我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說......大家肯定都記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病又不是你的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有點跑調的口哨音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子，塞爾蒙她哥，死了。說不定我們當時幫過的那一隊深池都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們白忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好......至少你還活著，失蹤了那麼久之後，你還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到葦草給你塞藥了，礦石病是不是其實能治好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她們都說是治不好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，請不要埋怨那些深池的士兵。我幫他們躲進工廠的運輸車，傷口滲入了源石粗礦的碎屑......這也不是他們的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我哪有埋怨呀，我只是覺得心裡難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都相信深池，可我不敢信。深池是比我們厲害，還有武器，但我們都親眼看到了，最後那隊人被打得有多慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池會對塔拉人好，幫塔拉人出口氣，可之後呢？我想不出來......我就只記得那天車廂上的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞爾蒙到現在還是想去找深池，去跟維多利亞人打仗，我都勸不住她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，那天她跟葦草聊了那麼久，葦草難道沒給她講清楚道理嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我覺得，塞爾蒙那麼做，不壞。她那樣的人，能為其他塔拉人做很多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得嗎？我感染之後不久，整個感染者街區的人一起被驅趕出了小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來，被驅趕出來的鎮民裡更健壯有力的那些，搶走了大家身上所有的物資，留下了羸弱的老人與孩子，還有我這樣在虛弱期的病人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你該早點說。說出來至少心裡沒那麼難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實，我都快記不清了。我都想不起來，為什麼沒人反抗，也沒人保護其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前我一直想，生活就是這樣子，手裡捧著的無論是什麼，只要肚子餓了，閉上眼睛就咽下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莎死在礦井底下，柯蘿達也死在礦井底下，你們家難道有人抱怨過礦場的工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我說不好，也許是不能抱怨誰，但至少大姐和二姐死的時候，我自己挺難過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想找人說說這些，但是又黑又悶的礦井底下，沒人聽我說。我跑出來兜售些雜貨，結果每家人都有自己的難處，也沒人聽我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，現在說也不遲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，現在也不遲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們撿的這些木柴，應該夠燒一晚上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨聲）......那就走吧，太陽落山了，等會你該看不清路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，鍋子咕嘟咕嘟冒泡啦，現在我能吃一口嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別心急，你這傻子！難道你家裡從來沒讓你燒過飯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去帳篷裡等著，等會肉煮好了我端過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她看起來心情好了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......但她一定還是很傷心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，讓她死了去深池的心，是件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你一直知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信有你在的話，他們不會踏錯路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然你很難一直陪著這些人走，德拉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會認錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"別瞎說，費加爾，去年的戲裡，你演的是蓋爾王的戰士。你演他重傷倒下三次又爬起來三次，結果把自己的胳膊和腿都摔青啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那我今年就演他刀槍不入好啦。年年都演蓋爾王戰敗，演加斯特里爾死在王城腳下，除了戲服上能綴點花，就再沒新鮮的東西啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，塞爾蒙，過來，坐過來。我看今年你可以扮演蓋爾王手下第一大將軍。雖然年紀小了點，但論氣勢，還真沒人能蓋過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是饞她端來的鍋子，才對她胡說。你看她自己都不願意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，你們在說什麼啊？我不認識這人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你家那邊到了夏天，不演那幾齣固定的劇目嗎？我們在商量怎麼分角色呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......演到最後，一個自稱河神的傢伙會站起來往觀眾身上灑水，那個活動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......見過，沒興趣參加，除非讓我演河神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"那是河神在為死掉的戰士哀悼呀。那段台詞可比其他角色的都難記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"但也說不定我們還沒建好房子，今年夏天就過去了。那你就能準備到明年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，說不定呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"看你這表情，你還想去找深池？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。你以為我跟你們一樣，說放棄就放棄了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是那天我跟葦草聊過之後得出的結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是相信，深池的夢想是可以實現的，也必須要有人去實現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想從我這裡打聽什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒什麼可過問。你做的事，我看在眼裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信我親眼所見得出的判斷，也信羅德島的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在大多數維多利亞人眼裡，活著的德拉克，只有一條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......深池的紅龍，塔拉的君主後裔。那一條紅龍就足夠讓公爵們各懷鬼胎，貴族們人心惶惶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定為難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......她知道我的身份嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她其實很聰明，心也很細。但很多事，尤其是和她認同的朋友有關的事情，她不願意往壞處想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣同行下去的話，她遲早得面對，你也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要勸我儘早離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做過的事情就是做過。需要你擔負的責任，你逃不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我覺得，對一些人而言，你是不是德拉克沒那麼重要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗啞的歌聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"細小的溪流梳過茵茵原野♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗啞的歌聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們為缺席的人舉杯♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......應該是費加爾在唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，聽起來，是一首關於酒和夏日原野的歌。我沒聽過......但很好聽。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拍打著翅膀醒來吧，水畔的羽獸♪\n把我們聚會的消息隨著水波帶走♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽得出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他們只是有了帳篷和火而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們有房舍和田地的時候，應該會更開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們進去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳陳，你們終於回來啦！快來看奧蘭先生的表演，他能吹響草稈欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖銳的哨笛音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，可能音不太準，我父親擅長這個，我只是簡單地跟他學了學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼——哼哼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你們不介意我跟著唱吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唱呀，這是我們的祝酒歌，我只介意酒瓶裡沒有酒，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，歌詞是什麼？我用維多利亞語唱行不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......要不還是換個人來，你先聽著好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"維恩，你來唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“這土地總是結出眼淚，我們卻飲下往昔的露與火。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"曲折小徑開滿玫瑰與風鈴草♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你跑調啦！唱功還得再練練！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！你自己也沒好到哪去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（刺耳的哨笛聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......求你，別弄出噪音了，哪有你這樣跟人吵架的呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，也別再拿石頭扔來扔去了！要是真沒躲過怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，好香的麵包......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以分你一半哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多謝啦！來，陳陳，你咬一口這個麵包，就一口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是很香？我在想，他們是拿什麼草做的香料呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......吃不出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，回炎國這麼久，你的口味是更挑剔了，還是變遲鈍了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得呢？其實龍門人夏天喝茶要用二十四種藥材熬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的？......你又在開玩笑啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你覺得高興嗎，葦草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們的生活原本可以是這樣的，當然，比這更好一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把生活還給了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"葦草，你是會講塔拉語的，別找藉口，唱呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（俏皮的哨笛聲）唱呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"載具在泥濘地帶會留下明顯的車轍，我們要繞路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，直接向目標地點前進吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀，還有你呢，莫蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫蘭小姐，幹嘛坐在那麼遠的地方呀？葦草都講了那麼多次沒關係了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，“卡邁河谷的吟遊詩人”......唱吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"籠罩溪谷的霧靄啊......將她遠行的身影遮蔽......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我是不是在好些年前聽過這個歌聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你肯定聽過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"對啦，我記得那時候我牽著我妹妹，她還沒病到走不動路呢。我們在石橋上站著，聽了好一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，卡邁河流得那麼遠，別處應該也有一樣的橋吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先控制平民，但不要讓任何人受傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的調查對象有相當優秀的軍事素養，儘量避免正面交戰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"塞爾蒙，你看，我這個招架姿勢怎麼樣？跟你學的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怎麼樣。你以後也就趕趕羽獸，學這個幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要和任何人溝通，一句話也不要說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後續的事情交給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，我們要在天亮前離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"架好弩箭，準備煙霧彈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我得出去緩口氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這個時間，起霧了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼時候......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
